[style name="Interaction_Style"]
if {Astrid.ask_for_help} == 1:
	[background arg="res://gui/Dialog/styles/Finished_Ian_room.webp" fade="0.0"]
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join Alinora rightmost
	Alinora: Thorinn! We need your help! Five villagers... they've fallen very ill, we’re afraid they’re dying. It's like a curse!
	Thorinn: A curse? What do you know of it?
	Alinora: Not much, but ... there is someone who might hel-..... no, i shouldn’t!
	Thorinn: What is it Alinora? Who are you talking about?
	Alinora: The doomed one... Malric. People say he dabbles in dark magic.
	Thorinn (normal): Malric... I haven't heared that name since I arried here. What do you know about him?
	Alinora: He was once part of the village, but he became obsessed with the future and so lost his way in the arts of divination. 
	Alinora: It's rumoured that exercising these dark arts required living beings, so our town elder exiled him to live in the woods.
	Alinora: If anyone does know about the cure... it’s him. His knowledge was unparalleled, even before... whatever he became.
	Thorinn: I'll go look for him.
	set {Astrid.ask_for_help} = 2
	[signal arg="end-night"]
